    "description": "PDF Viewer & Scanner can solve your document reading, editing and management needs in one stop.\r\n\r\n Main functions:\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcc4 Multi-format reading: Perfectly supports multiple document formats such as PDF, Word, PPT, Excel, etc., and can be easily read no matter when and where.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcdd PDF editing: Provides comprehensive PDF editing tools, including adding comments, text editing, inserting pictures and signatures, etc.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcf7 Convert photo to PDF: Use your phone\u2019s camera to quickly convert paper documents into PDF files.\r\n\r\n \u2702 PDF Merge and Split: Easily merge multiple PDF files into one, or split large PDF files into multiple parts.\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udd11 PDF encryption: Protect the security of your documents and encrypt PDF files by setting a password.\r\n\r\n Download PDF Viewer & Scanner now to make document processing simple, efficient and safe!",
